On GSM8K, the dose-response curve across $\alpha \in \{0.5, 1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 4.0\}$ reveals an inverted-U pattern peaking at $\alpha{=}2.0$ (SFT 64.97\%, GRPO 66.11\%, $\Delta{=}{+}1.14$\,pp; Table~\ref{tab:alpha}).
